# The server image's build context is the repository root (0046;
# packages/report-server/Dockerfile). Everything the image does not need is
# left out, so the context stays small and a machine's installs, builds or
# results cannot stand in for the ones the image makes.
# packages/report-server/src/dockerfile.test.ts holds the entries that matter.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/test-results
.git
.github
.claude
docs
apps
release-results
release-report
release-tarballs
.e-invoice-cache
.env
.env.*
